WEBVTT

00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:01.930
So

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:04.500
why don't you try acting like a lizard for now?

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:09.190
(Tennouji Family Temporary Butler Selection Event Hall)

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:08.070
Huh?

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:12.150
Did you not hear me?

00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:16.060
I said, move around in a circle three times and cry out, "Pigii!"

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:17.220
Hurry up and do it,

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:19.120
you useless bum!

00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:20.270
What!

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:25.440
This is one of the Tennouji Family's rightful heirs,

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:28.250
Tennouji Touka-sama.

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:29.180
Oh!

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:30.510
Tennouji...

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:31.800
Touka...

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:34.650
Huh!

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:39.800
Pigiiiii~!!!!

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:44.380
...now I've done it...

00:00:46.470 --> 00:00:47.680
Hmhm.

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:49.350
Wonderful!

00:00:49.430 --> 00:00:50.400
Bravo!

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:53.030
Khorosho! Japan's best!!

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:53.030
(Khorosho- Russian for bravo, used frequently in Japan)

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:27.010
I didn't think you'd actually do it.

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:28.330
("Ah, Ouch...")

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:29.070
What are you thinking?

00:02:29.190 --> 00:02:30.740
Y-you're the one who told me to...!

00:02:30.740 --> 00:02:31.890
Oh well.

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:33.320
I guess you'll do for now.

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:34.020
Huh?

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:35.890
I said you've passed.

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:37.630
Here, go get changed now.

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:40.590
Come to my room in exactly 15 minutes.

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:44.520
Work diligently as to not embarrass yourself since now you belong exclusively to me.

00:02:45.330 --> 00:02:47.310
If you are even half a second late,

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:49.480
I'll beat you with the Morningstar,

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:50.570
you got it!?

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:53.530
....exclusively...?

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:55.440
I may have forgotten to mention it,

00:02:55.640 --> 00:03:01.790
but your job requires you to live here as Touka-sama's personal butler.

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:04.240
(High rate guaranteed! Open qualification...)

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:02.680
What??

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:04.220
Um, but I...

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:07.520
(Now Hiring Maids)

00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:05.740
Uh, um...

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:07.270
actually, I'm

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:10.040
thinking of starting to work part time...

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:12.600
Part time... why would you...?

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:14.200
Uh, well, um...

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:16.330
I have something I want to get...

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:17.330
Hm?

00:03:18.260 --> 00:03:21.170
Thank you for waiting.
My master~

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:23.840
Oh.

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:26.050
Welcome back,

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:27.490
my master!

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:30.220
Wow~!!

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:33.300
Aw...

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:35.800
Present?

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:36.340
Yes.

00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:38.600
It's almost Christmas, right?

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:41.970
This person has been taking care of me all the time,

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:43.320
so

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:46.280
I really want to give him a present on my own...

00:03:46.850 --> 00:03:48.360
Is that person...?

00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:50.590
He's very kind,

00:03:50.990 --> 00:03:51.990
handsome,

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:53.980
and a wonderful person...

00:03:54.370 --> 00:03:54.880
hehe

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:56.750
I found out about Haruka's intentions,

00:03:57.260 --> 00:03:59.640
and decided to work too, but...

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:01.490
Grr!

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:04.040
You're 3 seconds late!

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:04.990
ughh

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:10.470
Didn't I say that if you were even half a second late, I'll beat you up with a zanbotou?

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:09.480
(zanbatou - one of the largest type of Japanese swords, designed to slay a horse and rider in one swing.)

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:12.340
Are you ready for this?

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:12.740
She's upped the level!?

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:13.860
Huh!

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:15.070
I'm just kidding.

00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:16.400
Geez,

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:18.310
you're as dumb as an amoeba.

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:20.280
You wanna start the cell division?

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:21.340
Well...

00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:24.390
starting today, you are my personal butler, huh?

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:26.210
What was your name?

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:27.100
A-

00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:27.990
aa-aya...

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:28.660
I got it!

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:30.830
From now on, you are Rodriguez!!

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:32.590
Huh?

00:04:32.590 --> 00:04:35.430
It's Rodriguez! Don't make me repeat it.

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:40.010
By the way, Rodriguez is the name of my lizard that I used to have.

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:43.410
Be thankful that you're getting named after him.

00:04:43.740 --> 00:04:46.680
Also, you don't have to use polite language you're not used to.

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:49.730
I mean, you're only a week long part-time butler.

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:54.510
Besides, you're only Rodriguez but are still my senpai in high school.

00:04:54.510 --> 00:04:55.110
What?

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:58.510
Then Tennouji is a freshman at Hakujou High School!?

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:00.580
Call me by my first name.

00:05:00.990 --> 00:05:03.410
I hate being called by my last name, Tennouji.

00:05:03.410 --> 00:05:04.790
Oh, s-sorry.

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:06.730
Anyways, I thought...

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:07.910
Thought...

00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:08.950
what?

00:05:09.610 --> 00:05:11.710
You were in middle school.

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:12.460
What!!

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:16.160
Wh-who are you calling an underdeveloped pet tiger!?

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:18.250
You Rodriguez!

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:20.420
W-well I didn't say that much...

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:21.450
You did!

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:23.220
No, you're eyes say that!

00:05:23.270 --> 00:05:24.050
Hah!

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:24.650
W-watch it..!!

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:25.850
Ah!!

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:27.850
Ouch...

00:05:27.850 --> 00:05:29.180
don't dodge...

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:30.630
Naah~!!

00:05:30.870 --> 00:05:33.300
Y-you little Rodriguez!! 

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:34.390
You perv-glasses!

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:38.260
Degenerate!! Should I spray onion juice directly into your eyes!?

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:41.220
Or otherwise put soy sauce onto your canker sore~!?

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:42.420
It wasn't even my fault...!!

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:43.240
Aghh!

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:44.480
Huhn!

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:46.470
I am the lead butler,

00:05:46.470 --> 00:05:48.890
Koinugawa Mudou.

00:05:48.570 --> 00:05:50.930
("dog")

00:05:49.190 --> 00:05:52.260
Do you have any questions?

00:05:53.230 --> 00:05:56.210
Well if not any, everything is questionable,

00:05:56.760 --> 00:05:58.960
but...what should I do right now?

00:05:59.080 --> 00:05:59.850
Hm...

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:03.730
Basically, your duty is to take care of Touka-ojousama.

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:07.060
Before, there were several butlers,

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:10.180
but they all quit at the same time the other day...

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:14.110
The part-timers we hired seemed to not have lived up to Ojousama's standards;

00:06:14.110 --> 00:06:18.220
they were forced to do the impossible, and as a result, they ran...

00:06:18.220 --> 00:06:20.830
ahem... resigned before the end of the day.

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:21.690
I see...

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:23.690
That lizard act must've done it!

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:26.230
Ojousama is at a difficult age now,

00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:29.170
and on top of that, there are some house matters these days...

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:30.860
Excuse me!

00:06:31.300 --> 00:06:33.520
I shouldn't be talking about that...

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:36.410
Well, aside from those matters,

00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:39.520
I am counting on you in many ways.

00:06:39.610 --> 00:06:40.230
Huh?

00:06:41.120 --> 00:06:48.790
I have a hunch that you have a power to change something here.

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:52.350
Yuuto~

00:06:52.350 --> 00:06:54.820
is breakfast ready yet~?

00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:56.510
Yuuto~

00:06:56.510 --> 00:06:58.230
answer me, at least!

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:00.230
Hey~ didn't Yuu-kun

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:03.390
start that in-house job?

00:07:03.390 --> 00:07:05.130
Oh yeah,

00:07:05.130 --> 00:07:07.100
huh... he was saying something like that...

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:08.490
Too bad.

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:09.350
Let's sleep.

00:07:09.350 --> 00:07:10.720
Sounds good.

00:07:10.720 --> 00:07:13.070
Good night~

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:14.080
Rodriguez!

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:15.280
What on earth is this?

00:07:17.740 --> 00:07:19.160
What do you mean...

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:20.670
it's breakfast just like you requested...

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:22.010
I want a traditional Japanese meal!

00:07:22.410 --> 00:07:23.950
Grilled fish and delicate soup...

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:25.590
Make it over at once!

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:30.610
Here! Grilled fish and delicate soup!

00:07:30.770 --> 00:07:32.010
What is this...

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:32.390
Oh?

00:07:32.640 --> 00:07:35.040
When I say grilled fish, I mean Ma-Iwashi (true sardine)!

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:37.600
Why would you use Urume-Iwashi(imitation sardine)!?

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:39.620
It's not a snack for drinkers!

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:41.140
Huh, yeah, but...

00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:43.020
No buts or huhs!

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:46.790
I like Ma-Iwashi, it's my favorite!

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:51.350
Stop talking back and do as I say, Rodriguez!

00:07:50.980 --> 00:07:51.930
Uguh!

00:07:52.510 --> 00:07:53.600
Geez...

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:54.560
alright?

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:56.870
If you do anything like this again,

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:59.240
I'll burn you to death!

00:08:00.430 --> 00:08:01.900
I want to go horseback riding.

00:08:02.030 --> 00:08:02.560
Huh?

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:05.010
Let's go Rodriguez, follow me!

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:06.240
Uh, um, wait?

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:08.820
Now Rodriguez,

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:11.170
bring that cute little pony over here.

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:13.330
Here, here here...

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:15.490
what!? What pony!?

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:17.010
Hurry up.

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:20.000
I'll give you his favorite treat, so get his attention.

00:08:20.090 --> 00:08:20.730
Huh?

00:08:20.870 --> 00:08:22.130
Neigh~!!

00:08:22.130 --> 00:08:22.810
Eh!?

00:08:22.990 --> 00:08:24.330
Waah!!

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:25.140
woh woh woah

00:08:25.140 --> 00:08:26.870
Ah he he he wah!

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:28.960
Ahahaha!

00:08:27.430 --> 00:08:28.850
Eeeeh!

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:33.110
All the sudden, I want some Moo-Moo Milk Organic Pure 100%.

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:35.080
Go get it in 20 minutes.

00:08:35.340 --> 00:08:36.640
Go, Rodriguez!

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:40.810
Geez,

00:08:40.810 --> 00:08:42.890
why is this happening to me?

00:08:43.070 --> 00:08:44.130
Here it...is...!?!?

00:08:44.130 --> 00:08:44.930
Kyaah!

00:08:44.930 --> 00:08:45.760
Ahh!

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:52.380
Ouch...

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:53.430
Ah!

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:55.680
Are you okay? I'll wipe it right off.

00:08:59.520 --> 00:09:00.030
Huh!?

00:08:59.950 --> 00:09:03.270
Y-y-you...

00:09:03.450 --> 00:09:04.970
fool! Stupid! Perv!

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:07.280
Perv machine! Perv monster!

00:09:06.660 --> 00:09:07.300
Dahhh!

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:08.630
You you you!!!

00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:07.990
Egh!

00:09:08.630 --> 00:09:12.640
Oh no! The milk dried and my hair stinks now!

00:09:15.260 --> 00:09:16.510
Hey Yuuto,

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:19.160
you look kind of exhausted these days.

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:20.500
Oh,

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:22.270
well, there's been a lot going on.

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:24.090
A lot, huh~?

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:27.210
Is it related to Nogizaka-san at all?

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:31.840
Are you working hard to get her something for Christmas?

00:09:31.950 --> 00:09:33.120
Hm? hmm!?

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:34.570
Uh, well...

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:35.040
Huh?

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:37.070
No way, really?

00:09:38.460 --> 00:09:39.570
So you really are...

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:40.850
Man,

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:43.240
I was more than half kidding.

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:44.360
Huh?

00:09:44.420 --> 00:09:46.240
Uh, nothing. Never mind.

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:47.280
Anyways,

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:48.880
I don't know what you're doing,

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:50.190
but don't overwork yourself.

00:09:50.570 --> 00:09:52.850
You can't do anything if you get sick.

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:54.060
Yeah,

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:55.230
thank you...

00:09:58.900 --> 00:10:00.130
Yawn...

00:10:00.460 --> 00:10:01.210
You're late!

00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:01.510
Hm?

00:10:01.730 --> 00:10:03.560
Why are you moving so slow!?

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:05.990
There are plenty of things to get done today too!

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:07.440
Hurry up and come,

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:09.560
you clumsy and slow Rodriguez!

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:10.810
Wah!

00:10:12.190 --> 00:10:16.060
Can... I survive till Chirstmas...?

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:21.970
(Moo-Moo Milk)

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:20.360
Moo-Moo Milk Organic Pure 100%!

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:26.810
(Rodriguez)

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:25.240
Ro-Rodriguez...?

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:32.520
Hmm...

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:34.520
You work pretty hard.

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:35.310
What!?

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:37.180
Up until now,

00:10:37.390 --> 00:10:41.370
everyone quit after an hour or half a day at the longest.

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:46.670
Are you surprisingly tough or just a stupid good-hearted guy?

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:48.020
Well,

00:10:48.270 --> 00:10:51.510
I'm pretty used to outrageous requests compared to most people.

00:10:51.510 --> 00:10:53.760
Ha~hahaha!

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:54.990
Gee...

00:10:54.990 --> 00:10:55.440
Huh?

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:57.540
Doesn't matter to me.

00:10:58.010 --> 00:11:05.060
Why don't you just work your soul out like a carriage horse that's been baited with an expensive carrot?

00:11:05.230 --> 00:11:06.570
Oh hey, that way is...

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:06.920
Huh?

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:07.890
Wahh!

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:08.580
Kyah!

00:11:16.470 --> 00:11:17.810
A-are you okay?

00:11:18.410 --> 00:11:22.570
Wh-why are there these stupid dirty wood shavings here!?

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:24.780
Well, these were here from the beginning.

00:11:24.860 --> 00:11:26.410
Don't make fun of me!

00:11:27.470 --> 00:11:28.330
Ah!

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.120
Hey, you're bleeding!

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:32.500
D-don't touch me!

00:11:32.760 --> 00:11:34.320
I'm fine, it's nothing.

00:11:34.580 --> 00:11:36.110
You're not okay!

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:37.470
Just wait for a second.

00:11:37.860 --> 00:11:38.550
Oh...

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:41.200
Here,

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:42.300
put your leg out.

00:11:42.670 --> 00:11:43.230
Huh?

00:11:44.960 --> 00:11:46.630
Oh! W-what are you doing!?

00:11:46.630 --> 00:11:48.710
You have to treat it right.

00:11:48.710 --> 00:11:50.710
It's your own pretty legs...

00:11:51.050 --> 00:11:52.990
what are you gonna do if it leaves a scar?

00:11:52.990 --> 00:11:55.090
Wh-wh-what are you saying?

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:56.640
Pretty...?

00:11:56.640 --> 00:11:59.640
Y-you can't say that when you're just a Rodriguez...

00:11:59.870 --> 00:12:00.690
Whatever.

00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:02.040
It's gonna sting a bit...

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:02.970
Ah!

00:12:02.970 --> 00:12:03.740
Uh...mm..

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:04.870
hold on...

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:05.660
Mm!

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:07.990
Ooh.

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:08.820
Ouch...

00:12:09.030 --> 00:12:10.470
It's almost done

00:12:23.600 --> 00:12:24.800
That'll do it.

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:28.250
Why...

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:30.330
why would you do this much?

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:31.180
Huh?

00:12:31.420 --> 00:12:34.410
Your job is to be my personal butler,

00:12:34.750 --> 00:12:37.940
so all you have to do is do whatever I tell you to do.

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:40.840
And I said I was okay.

00:12:41.120 --> 00:12:41.930
So why...?

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:45.520
I don't know...

00:12:45.520 --> 00:12:47.080
That's just weird...

00:12:47.430 --> 00:12:50.690
no one would do anything if it doesn't benefit them in any way.

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:53.250
It's always been like that.

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:55.720
Everyone around me,

00:12:56.480 --> 00:12:59.040
the life in this annoying house,

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:00.220
and everything...

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:03.130
that monstrous-stupid-grump too,

00:13:03.580 --> 00:13:05.260
that's how he got my mom to...

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:06.860
I guess I could understand...

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:11.610
but not everyone is only concerned about what would benefit themselves.

00:13:12.230 --> 00:13:15.850
There have to be some people who do things without that kind of thought.

00:13:16.490 --> 00:13:17.250
...I don't get it...

00:13:18.510 --> 00:13:21.360
I don't get any of it.

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:22.720
I'm going back to my room.

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:24.880
But...

00:13:25.430 --> 00:13:28.000
I'll thank you for treating my wound for now...

00:13:28.690 --> 00:13:30.230
but don't get any ideas.

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:32.820
Rodriguez is still just Rodriguez.

00:13:33.300 --> 00:13:35.920
Nothing more, nothing less.

00:13:36.590 --> 00:13:37.860
Hmm...

00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:44.650
Hello! Onii-san!

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:45.030
Ehh!

00:13:45.370 --> 00:13:47.500
I'm glad to see that you're doing well~

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:48.920
Wh-! Why are you guys here!?

00:13:49.630 --> 00:13:52.580
Of course it's because we were worried about you, onii-san.

00:13:52.770 --> 00:13:57.060
If we don't keep an eye out, you might get friendly with another girl.

00:13:57.320 --> 00:13:57.960
Huh?

00:13:58.050 --> 00:14:00.620
It looked pretty risky earlier too~

00:14:00.870 --> 00:14:02.060
It's not good~

00:14:02.210 --> 00:14:03.810
at times,

00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:07.890
pure kindness will become a sword of darkness that will harm everything possible.

00:14:07.890 --> 00:14:08.380
What!

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:10.220
W-were you guys watching...?

00:14:10.220 --> 00:14:12.550
Huhuhu...

00:14:11.360 --> 00:14:12.550
Huhuhu~

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:14.490
Teeheehee!

00:14:16.770 --> 00:14:17.860
In any case,

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:23.080
hats off to the "Tennouji House of the West", from the "Nogizaka House of the East".

00:14:23.570 --> 00:14:28.260
It was pretty hard making our way in here past the security system.

00:14:28.790 --> 00:14:29.900
It's no wonder.

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:35.630
The Tennouji are probably increasing their security due to various reasons.

00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:37.170
Huh? What reasons?

00:14:37.550 --> 00:14:42.960
The head of the house, Tennouji Tenzen, just passed away,

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:46.280
and now, they are arguing over the inheritance issues.

00:14:47.180 --> 00:14:48.600
Inheritance issues...

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:50.590
It's a family feud.

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:51.710
Also,

00:14:51.880 --> 00:14:54.770
Touka-sama, who Yuuto-sama is looking after,

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:56.860
is in a difficult position,

00:14:56.970 --> 00:15:01.580
on top of the fact that she is the third rightful heir.

00:15:14.610 --> 00:15:16.660
I didn't know Touka was going through so much...

00:15:17.540 --> 00:15:21.640
maybe that hopelessly awful personality and behavior is...

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:23.540
huh?

00:15:24.890 --> 00:15:26.090
Rodriguez!

00:15:26.240 --> 00:15:28.260
I want some miso fries tonight!

00:15:28.470 --> 00:15:31.750
If it's not the right sweet and spicy miso,

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:35.580
I'll make you kneel down on the hotplate and apologize!

00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:38.030
Nah,

00:15:38.420 --> 00:15:39.820
that's probably her true self.

00:15:42.280 --> 00:15:42.680
Uh...

00:15:43.310 --> 00:15:44.240
Hmm...

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:49.790
Th-that was alright.

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:54.630
Huh...

00:15:57.430 --> 00:16:00.090
I'm finally done for the day...

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:01.210
But

00:16:01.820 --> 00:16:06.030
by morning that little brat will create a rampage again...

00:16:08.620 --> 00:16:09.090
Huh?

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:11.960
Is it a black out?

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:15.550
Rodriguez! I know you're in there! Open up!

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:18.130
I'm telling you, open this door!

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:19.790
Wah!

00:16:19.930 --> 00:16:21.360
Ouch...

00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:22.600
Yeek! A cow...?

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:24.760
No, Touka?

00:16:24.910 --> 00:16:26.010
Wh-what?

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:28.830
Well anyways, is this a black out?

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:30.290
I-I don't know.

00:16:30.640 --> 00:16:33.640
Even if it was, this place should have a backup generator.

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:34.930
I see.

00:16:35.570 --> 00:16:38.570
Oh well. It'll come back soon enough.

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:41.330
H-here, Rodriguez, sit down.

00:16:41.690 --> 00:16:45.340
I'll accompany you until the light comes back on.

00:16:45.540 --> 00:16:46.120
Huh?

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:49.710
S-s-so I'll stay and talk.

00:16:49.950 --> 00:16:51.030
Aren't you bored?

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:53.270
Just to make it clear, it's only out of necessity.

00:16:53.670 --> 00:16:55.790
It's nothing more than that!

00:17:00.020 --> 00:17:00.760
Hm.

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:02.680
What are you looking at?

00:17:03.340 --> 00:17:04.070
Nah...

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:07.040
W-well? Say something.

00:17:07.300 --> 00:17:09.110
I don't care what as long as it distracts me...

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:14.560
no, I mean, I just feel like it right now so I'll listen to whatever you have to say.

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:17.030
Then, where did you get that gown?

00:17:17.230 --> 00:17:18.630
It's the Moo-Moo gown.

00:17:18.900 --> 00:17:24.570
When you collect and send in 5 barcodes of Moo-Moo Milk Organic Pure 100%, you're eligible for a prize raffle.

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:28.850
Isn't it perfect like they made it just for me?

00:17:28.950 --> 00:17:30.740
Y-yeah. I guess.

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:32.330
What else?

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:34.040
Don't bore me.

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:35.210
Umm...

00:17:35.440 --> 00:17:37.970
...they are arguing over the inheritance issues.

00:17:38.230 --> 00:17:38.820
Um,

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:42.730
so what does Touka think of this house?

00:17:44.300 --> 00:17:48.400
I want to leave this stupid house as soon as possible...

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:50.750
the only reason why I'm still here is...

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:55.000
because I need the power that the Tennouji Family has for what I must accomplish.

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:56.300
...accomplish what...?

00:17:58.350 --> 00:17:59.710
How could you not know!?

00:17:59.710 --> 00:18:01.420
I'm gonna take over the world!

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:04.030
I-I see.

00:18:04.030 --> 00:18:05.490
Well, take it easy.

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:09.240
For that, I absolutely need the power of Tennouji Family!

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:12.950
I can't let those useless dummies take it away!

00:18:13.140 --> 00:18:14.890
The lies are relative to her age, huh.

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:16.770
That's why I'm here. To take over everything!

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:22.950
Th-this bell is an emergency call!

00:18:22.980 --> 00:18:24.970
Woo...

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:26.100
I see them, over here!

00:18:26.230 --> 00:18:27.500
Gaah!

00:18:29.900 --> 00:18:30.700
Hey, Joe,

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:32.700
did you already drink your Moo-Moo Milk?

00:18:32.700 --> 00:18:34.660
Really bad and can't stand it...

00:18:34.660 --> 00:18:35.700
hey, they're here!

00:18:36.190 --> 00:18:37.510
Fire!

00:18:37.960 --> 00:18:38.630
Humph!

00:18:41.650 --> 00:18:42.860
Hyaah!

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:44.060
Gyaah!

00:18:45.190 --> 00:18:46.110
Touka-ojousama!

00:18:46.130 --> 00:18:47.020
Ayase-dono!

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:48.010
Are you safe!?

00:18:48.010 --> 00:18:49.330
What's going on?

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:51.120
I-it's an intrusion!

00:18:51.510 --> 00:18:54.010
Estimate is a team of two, both with weapons;

00:18:54.010 --> 00:18:57.100
they've breached security and are headed this way!

00:18:57.100 --> 00:18:57.870
I see.

00:18:57.870 --> 00:18:59.800
"I see"? You seem awfully calm.

00:19:00.380 --> 00:19:03.080
It happens all the time.

00:19:03.470 --> 00:19:08.840
There are countless rotten relatives who are after me.

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:13.750
Grr...

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:14.130
Oh!

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:15.290
They're already here!

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:17.820
Run, you two!

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:20.270
I'll stay behind!

00:19:20.270 --> 00:19:22.190
Nuooh!

00:19:22.190 --> 00:19:23.030
Oooh!!

00:19:24.090 --> 00:19:25.880
Gagh!!

00:19:25.880 --> 00:19:26.920
Mudou-san!

00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:28.610
oh huh...

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:28.570
This way.

00:19:28.610 --> 00:19:29.730
Grr...

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:30.780
Male...

00:19:30.780 --> 00:19:33.410
young male... fresh body...

00:19:35.220 --> 00:19:37.480
Rodriguez! Just leave me!

00:19:37.480 --> 00:19:39.280
You don't have to get caught up in this!

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:41.210
I can't do that!

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:42.710
Rodriguez! Why!?

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:47.130
Not everyone only thinks of their own benefits!

00:19:50.240 --> 00:19:51.240
Kyah!?

00:19:52.660 --> 00:19:53.730
You okay!?

00:19:53.730 --> 00:19:55.380
You should take off your slippers!

00:19:55.800 --> 00:19:56.800
Sh-shut up!

00:19:57.430 --> 00:19:59.890
Grr...

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:01.660
Grr...!

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:13.490
Yu-Yuuto...

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:15.710
I'm... hungry...

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:18.490
Feed me...

00:20:18.490 --> 00:20:19.720
Ahh...

00:20:19.990 --> 00:20:21.980
Ruko!? Yukari-sensei!!

00:20:24.860 --> 00:20:26.240
They're rotten...

00:20:26.920 --> 00:20:29.140
What? You know them?

00:20:29.140 --> 00:20:31.100
I'd like to say no, but...

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:33.290
they're my family and homeroom teacher...

00:20:33.650 --> 00:20:36.780
they probably found me out of animal instincts...

00:20:37.240 --> 00:20:38.090
sorry.

00:20:38.620 --> 00:20:40.860
It's okay, I mean,

00:20:41.210 --> 00:20:42.910
it was kinda fun.

00:20:42.910 --> 00:20:44.810
Hehehe.

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:49.700
Ayase-dono,

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:54.090
thank you for your hard work.

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:57.870
This is your entire paycheck.

00:20:58.180 --> 00:20:59.740
Thank you very much.

00:20:59.990 --> 00:21:00.430
huh?

00:21:03.770 --> 00:21:05.300
I'm very sorry,

00:21:05.420 --> 00:21:11.400
it's very difficult for me to say after you've saved Touka-ojousama, but...

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:19.070
When I subtracted the cost of the system destroyed by your onee-sama and of the treatment of the butlers,

00:21:19.070 --> 00:21:21.770
it ended up at that price...

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:22.900
What...

00:21:23.180 --> 00:21:27.410
I hear they destroyed more than half of the security system.

00:21:28.100 --> 00:21:29.080
Pretty impressive.

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:32.420
It's not easy to break the security system of Tennouji House.

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:33.360
Yeah...

00:21:33.360 --> 00:21:34.830
By the way, Rodriguez,

00:21:35.260 --> 00:21:36.920
what is your real name?

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:37.480
Huh?

00:21:37.670 --> 00:21:38.740
Your name!

00:21:38.930 --> 00:21:41.720
Your name can't just really be Rodriguez?

00:21:42.840 --> 00:21:44.080
...It's Ayase Yuuto.

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:45.280
Oh.

00:21:45.390 --> 00:21:46.300
Ayase Yuuto!

00:21:46.880 --> 00:21:48.180
Pigiiiii~!!!!

00:21:49.520 --> 00:21:50.840
Ayase Yuuto.

00:21:51.460 --> 00:21:54.010
I will never forget about that night.

00:21:54.690 --> 00:21:55.730
I promise...

00:21:55.810 --> 00:21:58.650
from now on, if something's ever to happen to you,

00:21:58.950 --> 00:21:59.580
I,

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:02.330
Tennouji Touka will be there to help.

00:22:05.050 --> 00:22:06.060
Touka...

00:22:06.800 --> 00:22:07.410
Oh,

00:22:07.410 --> 00:22:09.630
don't mistake my words!

00:22:09.630 --> 00:22:12.130
I just don't like to owe people favors!

00:22:12.130 --> 00:22:13.170
That's all.

00:22:13.350 --> 00:22:18.380
If you think of something weird, I'll beat you with Durandarte until you're brain falls out.

00:22:18.380 --> 00:22:19.800
Yeah, I got it.

00:22:22.060 --> 00:22:22.730
Hmph!

00:22:32.960 --> 00:22:33.850
Ayase...

00:22:34.270 --> 00:22:35.400
Yuuto...

00:22:37.940 --> 00:22:38.540
Hmph!

00:24:14.600 --> 00:24:17.930
(Nogizaka Vocabulary Fundamentals)

00:24:15.660 --> 00:24:17.940
Nogizaka Vocabulary Fundamentals!

00:24:17.930 --> 00:24:26.230
(Cosplay)

00:24:18.030 --> 00:24:19.330
This week's term is, "cosplay."

00:24:19.330 --> 00:24:21.220
An abbreviation of the words costume play,

00:24:21.370 --> 00:24:26.310
it's the act of wearing an anime character's costume or maid's uniform and acting it out.

00:24:26.230 --> 00:24:34.780
(Next: "Yuuto-san's Scent")

00:24:26.310 --> 00:24:30.440
In our next episode, onee-chan's gonna wear something outrageous while she approaches onii-chan!

00:24:30.660 --> 00:24:31.470
Look forward to it!

00:24:31.470 --> 00:24:32.080
Wh-what!?

00:24:32.080 --> 00:24:33.760
No one told me anything about that!

00:24:34.780 --> 00:24:39.820
(See you next week!)

00:24:34.780 --> 00:24:39.820
(Nogizaka Haruka no Himitsu - Purezza)
